[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3717742724","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114435#issuecomment-3717742724","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114435","id":3717742724,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7dmECE","user":{"login":"ttencate","id":90930,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkwOTMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/90930?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate","html_url":"https://github.com/ttencate","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ttencate/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-07T08:05:26Z","updated_at":"2026-01-07T08:05:26Z","body":"Found this PR while I was looking for this very feature.\r\n\r\nI think you could get rid of the word \"initial\". It's technically correct because the values can be changed at runtime – but that is true of many other settings as well (including Viewport Width and Viewport Height themselves).\r\n\r\nI'm not sure the wording \"Viewport\" is correct here. As implemented, these settings control the _window_ size, not necessarily the _viewport_ size (which is also affected by settings like aspect ratio and stretch mode).\r\n\r\nActually, controlling the viewport size might be the intent of most users, but that's a bigger can of worms, so I think this PR still does something useful.","author_